{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "160", "x": 0.8957535496958443, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.037989698907791414, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 2", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12378835115115883, "w": 0.07324626196581552, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Steve Wayne Wright (Elmley Town Council): Steve Wayne Wright from", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.15211877666808146, "w": 0.7715218588840385, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Elmley Town Council and I organize the town's volunteer scheme. I'm", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.1804491267422191, "w": 0.7714131824330053, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "delighted you're all interested in joining the scheme. Our volunteers help to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.20877947681635672, "w": 0.7717334703886916, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "create a sense of community among the many people who live in our historic", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23710982689049434, "w": 0.7718051353314012, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "town of Elmley and make residents and visitors feel welcome at local events.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2652919318920643, "w": 0.7715657395642669, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Uh first I'll mention just a few of the activities that volunteers carry out. One", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2936593243736476, "w": 0.7719901928730188, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "is to walk around on the town center streets wearing our volunteer t-shirt.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.321989731029874, "w": 0.7721148632168455, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Tourists often ask how to get to a particular shop and they might also be", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3503200811040116, "w": 0.7714130799080515, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "grateful for recommendations about what to visit. The town holds a large", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3786504311781492, "w": 0.771609312669634, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "number of concerts each year and part of the volunteers role is to get", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4069808189736794, "w": 0.7716305353350715, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "everyone in the audience to the right place as smoothly as possible. You'd be", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4353112067692095, "w": 0.7716961513055066, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "surprised how many people buy tickets then don't check them and head for", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4636415568433471, "w": 0.7714131824330053, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the wrong section of the hall. Volunteers may get involved with community", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4919966521509719, "w": 0.77184255693954, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "groups such as sports clubs or gardeners associations. Here the volunteers", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.520327039946502, "w": 0.7712606253017438, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "talk about how groups can help each other. For instance, a writing group", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5486573900206396, "w": 0.7715437992241526, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "might want to travel to another town to hear a talk by a well-known author,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5769877778161697, "w": 0.7721986261041041, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "but may not know that another club has a coach they could travel in. The", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6053181278903074, "w": 0.7714783883036251, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "town produces a monthly magazine and Anyone who lives in the town can", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.633648477964445, "w": 0.7715874748544735, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "send in articles. It's free to residents and is paid for by local businesses.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6620160213315983, "w": 0.7714349177232119, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "That's the responsibility of the council's advertising department. We depend", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6903462959629509, "w": 0.7718542447842737, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "on volunteers though to find out what people think of events they've", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7186767214798736, "w": 0.7715436966991989, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "attended and any suggestions they have for the future. The volunteers then", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7468587510386585, "w": 0.7715218588840385, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "send a summary to the editors. There are a number of clubs for retired", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7751891011127962, "w": 0.7721566933979979, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "people and Every year the council arranges lunch for all the members. The", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8035195266297188, "w": 0.7714131824330053, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "volunteers welcome the guests and when everyone's sitting down and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8318498767038565, "w": 0.7714348151982582, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "relaxing after the meal, some volunteers put on a show, usually around half", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8602049720114812, "w": 0.7713912420928911, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "an hour of songs and short plays. The club members really welcome the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8885353220856188, "w": 0.7718628568803932, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "chance to chat to the volunteers at these events. The town council has a", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9168656721597565, "w": 0.7714349177232119, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}